      "canonical_latex": "\\Delta < 0 \\implies \\text{saddle (unstable)};\\quad \\Delta > 0 \\land \\tau < 0 \\implies \\text{asymptotically stable (node/spiral)};\\quad \\Delta > 0 \\land \\tau > 0 \\implies \\text{unstable (node/spiral)};\\quad \\Delta > 0 \\land \\tau = 0 \\implies \\text{center (Lyapunov stable)}.",
